Z||000000||Brandon86SE||09-15-2001||02:54 AM||||I was on the way to Race City Speedway tonight to meet up with the other Calgary club members, and I got lost (damn detours).  Lucky for me, I found a great spot to take some pics of my car.  I've been meaning to do that for a couple weeks now.            <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif">  Anyway, I did end up finding the track and my best run of the night was a 15.333.  That's in a stock 86SE 2.8!  Unfortunately the pics from the track didn't really turn out.            <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/frown.gif">  But the ones I took of my car were great!  Here they are (I hope, first try posting pics):<P> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/Field_Back_(small).jpg"> <BR>rear view of my car.<P> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/Field_Front_(small).jpg"> <BR>front view of my car.<P> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/Interior_(small).jpg"> <BR>a not very good pic of my interior.<P> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/Open_Back_(small).jpg"> <BR>my car all opened up from the rear.<P> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/Open_Front_(small).jpg"> <BR>my car all opened up from the front.<P>Thanks!<P>Brandon<p>[This message has been edited by Brandon86SE (edited 09-15-2001).]||||reg||1
