Z||000010||sqoach||09-15-2001||01:50 PM|||| <BLOCKQUOTE><font size="1" face="Verdana, Arial, Helvetica">quote:</font><HR>Originally posted by PAUL88GT:<BR><B>Nice car.  My 86se looks the same except it currently has one red fender and a silver rear deck with spoiler.  The rest is gold.  <P>Do you guys have any wheat in Alberta?<P>I flew in to Calgary about two years ago on my way up to Banff.  Very beautiful area.</B><HR></BLOCKQUOTE><P>Hehe...mine too. But you can't tell from my sig pic. It has silver fenders, red and primer grey nose, and now a white GT wing. I hope to paint those parts pretty soon to get it to look a little better.  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif"><P>------------------<BR>-Adam<BR><FONT COLOR="BLUE">sqoach@yahoo.com</FONT><BR>         <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/sqoach.gif">   <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/halfpole.gif">         <BR>^^^^^^<B>new project</B>^^^^^^<BR><LI><FONT SIZE="1">84 SE (FOR SALE)*sale pending*<BR><LI>85 Coupe (parts car)($50)*sale pending*<BR><LI>86 SC (FOR SALE)</FONT>||||reg||1
